### Add media: valid request (needs a small sample image next to this file)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/media
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary #fail till #96

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TechnologyCodes"

mesh-boom-hd
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TitleEn"

Test title
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TitleEs"

Título de prueba
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TitleFr"

Titre de test
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
--WebAppBoundary--

